                                "sense_id": "ce747c9a-4f6e-364a-8717-a6cf0a82c979",
                                "text": "At first they wouldn't believe him, but he gave them proof. X-ray the Adulteress, he told them, and you will find an underpainting. They did and found the underpainting van Meegeren had described."
                            }
                        ]
